msgstr "Lier à « %s »"

#: assets/build/classic.js:3 assets/build/editor.js:3
msgctxt "button: add the link to the text"
msgid "Link"
msgstr "Lier"

#. translators: %s: title of the destination.
#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Dismiss the suggestion for “%s”"
msgstr "Ignorer la suggestion pour « %s »"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Ignorer"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "The site has not been analyzed yet, so there are no suggestions. Analyze it from the report and come back."
msgstr "Le site n’a pas encore été analysé, il n’y a donc aucune suggestion. Analysez-le depuis le rapport, puis revenez ici."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Open the report"
msgstr "Ouvrir le rapport"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "This entry is not analyzed yet. Save it and refresh in a moment, or check that its content type is analyzed in Settings."
msgstr "Cette publication n’est pas encore analysée. Enregistrez-la et actualisez dans un instant, ou vérifiez dans les réglages que son type de contenu est analysé."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Other entries can only link to this one once it is published."
msgstr "Les autres publications ne pourront faire un lien vers celle-ci qu’une fois qu’elle sera publiée."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "You have dismissed all the suggestions. They come back when you refresh."
msgstr "Vous avez ignoré toutes les suggestions. Elles reviendront quand vous actualiserez."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "There are no suggestions with enough confidence. This usually happens with very short entries or on a topic that has no other content on the site yet."
msgstr "Aucune suggestion n’est suffisamment fiable. Cela arrive généralement avec des publications très courtes ou sur un sujet qui n’a pas encore d’autre contenu sur le site."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "No other entry has a sentence that fits a link to this one yet."
msgstr "Aucune autre publication ne contient encore de phrase où un lien vers celle-ci aurait sa place."

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Réessayer"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Looking for suggestions…"
msgstr "Recherche de suggestions…"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
msgid "Inbound suggestions pages"
msgstr "Pages des suggestions entrantes"

#: assets/build/classic.js:4 assets/build/editor.js:4
